      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790864242016,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "21.1.3\n\n21 - major - at least one breaking change - a change that *could* break your code, but might not.\n\n1 - minor - if this increments, the developer is saying that this new version\n             has at least one new, backward compatible, feature. read the release notes.\n3 - patch - if this increments, the developer is saying this new version has \n               backward compatible bug fixes. - probably should take them.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "21.1.3\n\n21 - major - at least one breaking change - a change that *could* break your code, but might not.\n\n1 - minor - if this increments, the developer is saying that this new version\n             has at least one new, backward compatible, feature. read the release notes.\n3 - patch - if this increments, the developer is saying this new version has \n               backward compatible bug fixes. - probably should take them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
